{
  "story_id": "whale-road",
  "chapter": 3,
  "total_duration_ms": 330096,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "When Vidar sang the last note, he held it for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 1397,
      "end_ms": 5320
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "As long as he could.",
      "start_ms": 5320,
      "end_ms": 6717
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Longer than he could — his breath ran out and he had to stop before he wanted to.",
      "start_ms": 6717,
      "end_ms": 12170
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "And then there was silence in the bay.",
      "start_ms": 12170,
      "end_ms": 14763
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The whale did not move.",
      "start_ms": 14763,
      "end_ms": 16359
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Bjarni did not move.",
      "start_ms": 16359,
      "end_ms": 17756
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Vidar did not move.",
      "start_ms": 17756,
      "end_ms": 19086
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "The only sound was the soft slap of water against the black rocks.",
      "start_ms": 19086,
      "end_ms": 23608
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "For a moment Vidar thought the whale would just leave, the way stories were supposed to end.",
      "start_ms": 23608,
      "end_ms": 29792
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "But he did not, right away.",
      "start_ms": 29792,
      "end_ms": 31654
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "He stayed for maybe another thirty seconds, watching Vidar.",
      "start_ms": 31654,
      "end_ms": 35645
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "His eye did not blink.",
      "start_ms": 35645,
      "end_ms": 37174
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "He seemed to be taking Vidar in — every part of him.",
      "start_ms": 37174,
      "end_ms": 40699
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "And Vidar looked back, and he understood, in that thirty seconds, that the whale had recognized something.",
      "start_ms": 40699,
      "end_ms": 47814
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "That the whale had heard the song from Bjarni's mother when Bjarni was six.",
      "start_ms": 47814,
      "end_ms": 52868
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "That the whale had heard it from Bjarni's grandfather.",
      "start_ms": 52868,
      "end_ms": 56526
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "That the whale had heard it, in a way, in every generation.",
      "start_ms": 56526,
      "end_ms": 60516
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "That he had not forgotten.",
      "start_ms": 60516,
      "end_ms": 62311
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "That he had come back for it.",
      "start_ms": 62311,
      "end_ms": 64307
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "And now he had heard it again.",
      "start_ms": 64307,
      "end_ms": 66368
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "He had come, he had heard, and it was enough.",
      "start_ms": 66368,
      "end_ms": 69494
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "The whale rolled slowly.",
      "start_ms": 69494,
      "end_ms": 71156
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "He came upright.",
      "start_ms": 71156,
      "end_ms": 72287
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "His huge back was above the water for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 72287,
      "end_ms": 75479
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "He turned.",
      "start_ms": 75479,
      "end_ms": 76210
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Slowly and with dignity, he began to swim back toward the mouth of the bay.",
      "start_ms": 76210,
      "end_ms": 81264
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "His tall fin moved through the water.",
      "start_ms": 81264,
      "end_ms": 83791
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Vidar watched him go.",
      "start_ms": 83791,
      "end_ms": 85254
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Bjarni watched with him.",
      "start_ms": 85254,
      "end_ms": 86917
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Neither of them said anything.",
      "start_ms": 86917,
      "end_ms": 88978
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "The whale reached the mouth of the bay.",
      "start_ms": 88978,
      "end_ms": 91638
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "He dove.",
      "start_ms": 91638,
      "end_ms": 92237
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "He was gone.",
      "start_ms": 92237,
      "end_ms": 93168
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Vidar sat down on the rock.",
      "start_ms": 93168,
      "end_ms": 95030
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "His legs were shaking.",
      "start_ms": 95030,
      "end_ms": 96560
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "He was tired.",
      "start_ms": 96560,
      "end_ms": 97491
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "He had not known how tired he was until it was over.",
      "start_ms": 97491,
      "end_ms": 101015
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Bjarni sat down beside him.",
      "start_ms": 101015,
      "end_ms": 102877
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Neither of them said anything for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 102877,
      "end_ms": 106003
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "After maybe ten minutes, Bjarni said, quietly, \"You did it, Vidar.",
      "start_ms": 106003,
      "end_ms": 110458
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "You did the whole song.",
      "start_ms": 110458,
      "end_ms": 112054
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "He heard the whole thing.\" \"I could not sing at first,\" Vidar said.",
      "start_ms": 112054,
      "end_ms": 116576
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "\"I forgot how.",
      "start_ms": 116576,
      "end_ms": 117574
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "I got scared.\" Bjarni said, \"But then you did.",
      "start_ms": 117574,
      "end_ms": 120699
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "That is what matters.",
      "start_ms": 120699,
      "end_ms": 122162
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "He waited for you.",
      "start_ms": 122162,
      "end_ms": 123426
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "He did not leave.",
      "start_ms": 123426,
      "end_ms": 124623
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "He knew you would come back.",
      "start_ms": 124623,
      "end_ms": 126551
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "And you did.\"",
      "start_ms": 126551,
      "end_ms": 127416
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "They sat on the rock for another hour.",
      "start_ms": 127416,
      "end_ms": 130023
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "The bay went back to normal.",
      "start_ms": 130023,
      "end_ms": 131962
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "A puffin flew past.",
      "start_ms": 131962,
      "end_ms": 133299
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "The wind picked up a little.",
      "start_ms": 133299,
      "end_ms": 135238
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "The clouds moved across the sun.",
      "start_ms": 135238,
      "end_ms": 137444
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Nothing about the world looked any different than it had that morning.",
      "start_ms": 137444,
      "end_ms": 142190
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "But everything was different.",
      "start_ms": 142190,
      "end_ms": 144196
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "It had happened.",
      "start_ms": 144196,
      "end_ms": 145333
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "It had happened in Vidar's generation, in Vidar's tenth year, and Vidar had been part of it, and it would be another sixty or seventy years now before it happened again.",
      "start_ms": 145333,
      "end_ms": 156698
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Vidar tried to picture himself at seventy, standing on this rock with a grandchild of his own, watching a whale come into the bay.",
      "start_ms": 156698,
      "end_ms": 165455
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "It did not seem impossible.",
      "start_ms": 165455,
      "end_ms": 167327
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "It seemed very possible.",
      "start_ms": 167327,
      "end_ms": 168998
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "It seemed almost decided.",
      "start_ms": 168998,
      "end_ms": 170803
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Bjarni said, \"When we go up to the cottage, I am going to write it in the family book.",
      "start_ms": 170803,
      "end_ms": 176620
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Nineteenth of July, 2027.",
      "start_ms": 176620,
      "end_ms": 178358
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "The whale came.",
      "start_ms": 178358,
      "end_ms": 179428
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Vidar Petersen sang the song.",
      "start_ms": 179428,
      "end_ms": 181433
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "That is what I will write.",
      "start_ms": 181433,
      "end_ms": 183238
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "And then that page will be there, in the book, when your grandchild is learning the song.",
      "start_ms": 183238,
      "end_ms": 189255
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Someday they will look at it.",
      "start_ms": 189255,
      "end_ms": 191260
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Someday they will know that you were the one who sang.",
      "start_ms": 191260,
      "end_ms": 194937
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "That is how this works.\"",
      "start_ms": 194937,
      "end_ms": 196676
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "That evening Bjarni brought out the family book.",
      "start_ms": 196676,
      "end_ms": 199951
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "It was heavy and very old.",
      "start_ms": 199951,
      "end_ms": 201756
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Vidar had seen it many times but he had never really been allowed to read it — it had been for adults.",
      "start_ms": 201756,
      "end_ms": 208642
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Bjarni opened it now.",
      "start_ms": 208642,
      "end_ms": 210113
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "He turned to the last-used page.",
      "start_ms": 210113,
      "end_ms": 212319
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "It was Bjarni's own entry, from 1962.",
      "start_ms": 212319,
      "end_ms": 214860
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "It said: 19 July 1962.",
      "start_ms": 214860,
      "end_ms": 216397
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "The whale came.",
      "start_ms": 216397,
      "end_ms": 217467
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Ingrid Petersen sang the song.",
      "start_ms": 217467,
      "end_ms": 219539
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Her son Bjarni stood with her.",
      "start_ms": 219539,
      "end_ms": 221679
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Bjarni turned the page to the next blank one.",
      "start_ms": 221679,
      "end_ms": 224754
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "He took a black-inked pen.",
      "start_ms": 224754,
      "end_ms": 226559
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "He wrote, in his careful old handwriting: 19 July 2027.",
      "start_ms": 226559,
      "end_ms": 230303
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "The whale came.",
      "start_ms": 230303,
      "end_ms": 231372
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Vidar Petersen sang the song.",
      "start_ms": 231372,
      "end_ms": 233378
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "His grandfather Bjarni stood with him.",
      "start_ms": 233378,
      "end_ms": 235985
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "He blew on the ink.",
      "start_ms": 235985,
      "end_ms": 237322
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "He closed the book.",
      "start_ms": 237322,
      "end_ms": 238659
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "He handed it to Vidar.",
      "start_ms": 238659,
      "end_ms": 240197
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "\"This is yours to keep, now.",
      "start_ms": 240197,
      "end_ms": 242135
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "This book.",
      "start_ms": 242135,
      "end_ms": 242871
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Not to show anyone.",
      "start_ms": 242871,
      "end_ms": 244208
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Not to talk about.",
      "start_ms": 244208,
      "end_ms": 245478
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "It is a Petersen thing.",
      "start_ms": 245478,
      "end_ms": 247083
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "You keep it until it is time to give it to your child, or your grandchild — whoever is going to be the one to sing next time.",
      "start_ms": 247083,
      "end_ms": 255506
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "You will know who they are.",
      "start_ms": 255506,
      "end_ms": 257378
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "When they are the right person, you will know.\"",
      "start_ms": 257378,
      "end_ms": 260520
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Vidar went back to the rock that evening, at sunset.",
      "start_ms": 260520,
      "end_ms": 264056
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "He did not know why.",
      "start_ms": 264056,
      "end_ms": 265456
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "He did not expect to see anything.",
      "start_ms": 265456,
      "end_ms": 267791
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "He took his binoculars anyway.",
      "start_ms": 267791,
      "end_ms": 269859
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "He sat on the rock and looked out at the empty bay.",
      "start_ms": 269859,
      "end_ms": 273328
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "He watched for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 273328,
      "end_ms": 275196
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "He knew he would probably not see the whale again in his life.",
      "start_ms": 275196,
      "end_ms": 279398
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Sixty, seventy years.",
      "start_ms": 279398,
      "end_ms": 280866
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "The whale, if he was young, might come back one more time before the whale died — around the time Vidar was Bjarni's age.",
      "start_ms": 280866,
      "end_ms": 289004
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "If the whale was old, this might have been his last.",
      "start_ms": 289004,
      "end_ms": 292540
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Vidar was not sure how to feel about that.",
      "start_ms": 292540,
      "end_ms": 295408
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "He hoped the whale had had a good life.",
      "start_ms": 295408,
      "end_ms": 298076
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "He hoped he had a family somewhere.",
      "start_ms": 298076,
      "end_ms": 300545
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "He sat for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 300545,
      "end_ms": 302146
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Then he stood up and he walked back to the cottage.",
      "start_ms": 302146,
      "end_ms": 305614
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Bjarni was making supper.",
      "start_ms": 305614,
      "end_ms": 307349
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "The peat fire was warm.",
      "start_ms": 307349,
      "end_ms": 308950
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Everything was quiet.",
      "start_ms": 308950,
      "end_ms": 310417
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "And Vidar thought, this is the story I will tell my grandson someday.",
      "start_ms": 310417,
      "end_ms": 315087
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "This is the day I will remember more than any other day.",
      "start_ms": 315087,
      "end_ms": 318889
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "And he thought, also, that being ten years old could be a very heavy thing, and a very good thing, and that both were true at once, and that you did not have to choose.",
      "start_ms": 318889,
      "end_ms": 330096
    }
  ]
}